# Vivado temporary and generated project data
**/.Xil/
**/*.cache/
**/*.gen/
**/*.hw/
**/*.ip_user_files/
**/*.runs/
**/*.sim/
**/xsim.dir/

# Vivado IP output products are regenerated from the .xci configuration.
# Keep each IP directory and its .xci source, but ignore generated HDL,
# netlists, constraints, reports, and simulation products below it.
**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**
!**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/
!**/rtl/xilinx_ip/**/*.xci

# Projects generated by run_vivado scripts
**/run_vivado/project/

# Vivado logs and journals
*.jou
*.log
*.pb
*.str
*.wdb
*.dmp
*.tmp
*.backup.*

# Generated implementation products
*.dcp
*.bit
*.bin
*.ltx
*.xsa

# OS/editor files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
